Note on licenses
---------------------------------------------------------------------

rbacgo depends on the latest stable releases of the components above. The
copyright holders retain ownership of their respective works. Users
redistributing rbacgo or its adapters must retain this file and the notices
above. When PostgreSQL is used via pgx, the pgx notice applies; when the
SQLite store is used, the go-sqlite3 notice applies; when the Redis cache
backend is used, the go-redis notice applies.

No MPL-2.0 components are used. go-sql-driver/mysql was removed in favor of
PostgreSQL + SQLite, and hashicorp/golang-lru was replaced with an in-house
LRU implementation (see third-party.md, decision ADR-008).
